            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SleekDemo 2.0.0</h2>
<p>The first release of SleekDemo for Mac.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Recorder</strong> — screen or window, system audio, microphone and camera, with a live camera preview.</li>
  <li><strong>Smooth camera motion</strong> — spring-based zooms with motion blur and a jitter-free follow camera.</li>
  <li><strong>Auto zooms from your clicks</strong>, camera cutouts that shrink while zoomed, and on-device captions.</li>
  <li><strong>Export</strong> to MP4 or GIF, and automatic updates.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
